<title>AUSTRALIA: Coal Allied oversupply weighs on prices.</title>
<headline>Coal Allied oversupply weighs on prices.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coal miner Coal and Allied Industries ltd said on Tuesday that while the demand for coal remained strong, the oversupply of thermal coal continued to keep prices down.</p>
<p>Coal and Allied earlier reported a half year net loss of A$8.76 million.</p>
